 Chlorophyll catches energy from the sun.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af12\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain  2.\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\cs17\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b\animtext0\f9\loch
