Ship of Theseus}{}}}\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\lang1033\hich\af5\loch\strike0\fs24\lang1033\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f5\loch
 paradox. }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af12\langfe2052\loch\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi0\sb180\sa240\ltrpar{\hich\af5\loch\strike0\fs24\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f5\loch
