you will both say NO}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
. If you both say NO, your chance of leaving is }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\cs17\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
0%}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
 and nothing changes.}
