\u1055\'cf\u1110\'b3\u1076\'e4\u1082\'ea\u1072\'e0\u1078\'e6\u1110\'b3\u1090\'f2\u1100\'fc, \u1095\'f7\u1080\'e8 \u1087\'ef\u1086\'ee\u1090\'f2\u1088\'f0\u1110\'b3\u1073\'e1\u1077\'e5\u1085\'ed \u1074\'e2\u1072\'e0\u1084\'ec }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\cs17\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f5\loch
