The Reversed Grading Scale:}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
 In Germany (where Einstein grew up), "1" was the best grade and "6" was the worst. In Switzerland (where he finished high school), it was the exact opposite: "6" was the top grade and "1" was a fail. Early biographers saw his Swiss report card covered in 6s and mistakenly reported that he was a terrible student.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af12\langfe2052\loch{\listtext\pard\plain  2.\tab}\ilvl0\ls28 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\tx0\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\cs17\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
The College Entrance Exam:}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
 At age 16, he tried to test into college early. He }{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\cs17\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
scored exceptionally high in math and physics}{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
, but failed the non-science sections (like French language, literature, and politics). Because of this, he wasn't admitted and had to finish high school first.}
\par \pard\plain \s22\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\sl276\slmult1\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af12\langfe2052\loch\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi0\sb0\sa0{\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\strike0\fs22\ulnone\ulc0\b0\animtext0\f9\loch
Einstein did hate the strict, military-style discipline of his early German school and often argued with teachers\uc2 \u8212\'81\'5cbut he always excelled at math.\uc1 }
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af14\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1058\langfe2052\hich\af3\loch\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\f3\fs24\lang1058\kerning1\dbch\af12\langfe2052\loch\ql\rtlch\afs22\ab0 \ltrch\hich\af9\loch\fs22\b0\f9\loch

